WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.560
Welcome to DBL Group's TalentHub!

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.240
Is your name on a
requisition's approval chain?

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.920
In this video we'll see how to review a
requisition, how to give your decision,

4
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.440
and how to correct it when needed.
Let's get started!

5
00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:23.030
On the Dashboard, Latest Requisitions
and the bell show what is waiting

6
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:29.750
for your signature. Your job is one
of three things: Approve, Reject,

7
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.300
or Need more info. And only on
the level that carries your name.

8
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:38.661
Nobody grants this role separately.
When Head of Talent Acquisition puts

9
00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:44.980
your name on a raiser's chain in Approval
Paths, your access is created right there.

10
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.540
Named, you can sign in;
removed, you cannot.

11
00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:54.370
Sign in with your DBL email
and password. The menu is short:

12
00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:59.810
Dashboard, Requisitions, where the
requisitions on your chain appear,

13
00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:04.410
Organogram, and Notifications
are the ones you will use.

14
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.920
When a requisition reaches your level, the
bell tells you, and email too if you like.

15
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:15.800
Click the notification and the
requisition opens on the Approvals tab:

16
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:21.080
the whole chain, who has signed,
who has not, and whose turn it is now.

17
00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:25.790
Before deciding, look around.
The Details tab has section A,

18
00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.190
what the raiser asked for: the post,
how many, when, who is being replaced, and

19
00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:37.110
the requirement type, New or Replacement,
which comes from the organogram.

20
00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:42.372
The Job Analysis tab has Factory HR's
section B: job description, education,

21
00:01:42.492 --> 00:01:47.500
experience, others, and any files they
attached. The facility requirements,

22
00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:53.780
laptop, transport, dormitory,
are on the Details tab.

23
00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:58.490
Back on Approvals: a remark box
and three buttons. Approve sends

24
00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:04.677
it to the next level; if you are the
last one, the requisition is Approved.

25
00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:10.050
Reject ends it there, and it cannot
be brought back, so write the reason.

26
00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.183
Something unclear? Need more info.

27
00:02:13.303 --> 00:02:16.840
The remark is required,
say what you want to know.

28
00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:22.320
The requisition goes back to the raiser
and the chain pauses. Let me show you.

29
00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.670
The raiser fixed it
and clicked Send for approval.

30
00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:32.390
Now notice: the chain restarts from level
one. Anyone who signed before signs again.

31
00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.931
So it is back on your desk.

32
00:02:37.281 --> 00:02:43.561
While the requisition is with you,
you can make small corrections yourself.

33
00:02:43.681 --> 00:02:48.761
Click Edit details,
say I change the priority, Save changes.

34
00:02:49.441 --> 00:02:52.529
Every change goes into the
history under your name.

35
00:02:52.879 --> 00:02:55.673
All good. Remark or no remark, Approve.

36
00:02:55.793 --> 00:03:01.559
The status stays Pending Approval;
only the turn moves to the next person,

37
00:03:01.679 --> 00:03:04.879
here Mahmuda Akhter. She has been told.

38
00:03:05.229 --> 00:03:10.149
One rule to remember. Only the
person named on the level can sign.

39
00:03:10.709 --> 00:03:16.429
Whatever their role, nobody can jump the
queue. The one exception is a super user.

40
00:03:16.779 --> 00:03:20.899
The final level has one extra button,
Send to CHRO,

41
00:03:21.579 --> 00:03:26.779
for pushing the decision up. It exists
only on the last level, not in the middle.

42
00:03:27.129 --> 00:03:32.609
The statuses at a glance.
Job Analysis, with Factory HR.

43
00:03:33.049 --> 00:03:38.370
Pending Approval, on the chain.
Approved, everyone signed.

44
00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:44.249
Profile Ready and Posted,
recruitment under way. Rejected, closed.

45
00:03:44.599 --> 00:03:47.879
You are told when a
requisition reaches your level,

46
00:03:47.999 --> 00:03:50.799
when the raiser resends it,
and when the chain completes.

47
00:03:50.919 --> 00:03:54.359
And if it sits three days,
a reminder arrives in the morning.

48
00:03:54.709 --> 00:03:57.149
Want it by email? Keep Email notifications

49
00:03:57.269 --> 00:03:59.909
on under the Notifications
tab in Settings.

50
00:04:00.259 --> 00:04:05.019
A common question.
I can see the requisition, why no buttons?

51
00:04:05.379 --> 00:04:08.299
Look at the Approvals
tab for whose turn it is.

52
00:04:08.979 --> 00:04:11.859
Until it reaches your level,
the buttons do not appear.

53
00:04:12.209 --> 00:04:16.729
Another one. I rejected it,
can it come back? No. The

54
00:04:17.329 --> 00:04:23.169
raiser has to raise it afresh. So before
Reject, consider Need more info once.

55
00:04:23.519 --> 00:04:28.440
In short. From the bell to the
requisition, the Approvals tab.

56
00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.640
Read Details and Job Analysis.

57
00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:37.480
Approve, Reject, or Need more info.
Once everyone has signed, it is Approved,

58
00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:40.399
and Head of Talent Acquisition
starts recruitment.

59
00:04:40.749 --> 00:04:44.069
The full guide is a PDF under Tutorials.

60
00:04:44.589 --> 00:04:48.669
Sign-in trouble,
the IT Helpdesk. Thank you.

